<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3-year government bond yield 19.19 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3-year government bond yield 19.19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's three-year government bonds was set by auction at 19.19 percent, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    2000/D BOND</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    20,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     82,635.52 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   19,999.98 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		26,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	  19.19 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		  100.29 pct</p>
<p>Note: The bond, to be issued on January 20, bears a fixed interest rate of 18.5 percent, payable semi-anually starting from August 12, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
